          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Likewise, I inform you that letters arrived from the elder [ \u2026 to ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Y\u016bsuf and to Ma\u1e25r\u016bz. In them, he reports o[n \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">on the journey, and that he heard that you have somethi[ng] in Aden [ \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">a letter from him. He did not report any of this. [I] asked [ \u2026 and he reported]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Ab\u016b Zikr\u012b in his letter regarding Ab\u016b Sa\u02bf[\u012bd \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the matter. I wrote this letter of mine and did not [ \u2026 ]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">at the time of sale, a loss of 54 ra\u1e6dls from the weight of the pep[per \u2026 ]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">work [ \u2026 ] the <i>fur\u1e0da</i> or the warehouse. [His] sla[ve was sick \u2026 from the month</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">of \u1e6cevet to the month of Sivan. From the Almighty Creator (came) [health \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">delayed at home. Some of it was after [ \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u00a0I already sent this letter of yours with [ \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">my dear lo[r]d, he (i.e., I) greet him with the most perfect peace [ \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">not a little of it was sold, nor a lot. Greet [our associates on my behalf \u2026 in]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Bharuch \u2014\u00a0the great and the minor \u2014 with the most perfect pe[ace \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Your slave acquired the value of the mi\u1e25bas: a <i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i> l[ess \u2026 and the value of]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the coconuts: a <i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i> less a quarter. Altogether 3 <i>d\u012bn\u0101</i>[<i>r</i>s \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">I heard, my lord, when he arrived, that he had with him a bag [ \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">this year. I asked him about it and he is a destitute boy [ \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">He already received it from me, and Mahr\u016bz provided me the guarantee [ \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">I wrote it in a copy describing everything [ \u2026 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">al-Barak\u0101t al-\u1e24alab\u012b as you wrote in your letters [ \u2026 ]</li></ol>\n\n<p></p>",
